  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "鯉魚王的分類是魚寶可夢，\n而醜醜魚也一樣是魚寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9BC99B5A738B76845206985E662F9B5A5BF653EF5922FF0C000A800C919C919C9B5A4E5F4E006A23662F9B5A5BF653EF5922300200100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但在密阿雷卻看不到醜醜魚，\n明明都是魚寶可夢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4657285BC6963F96F7537B770B4E0D5230919C919C9B5AFF0C000A660E660E90FD662F9B5A5BF653EF59222026202600100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以說，如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有帶著醜醜魚的話，\n能不能請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳讓給我？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58AAAFF0C5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B367095E368457919C919C9B5A76848A71FF0C000A80FD4E0D80FD8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B38B937D666211FF1F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意把醜醜魚讓給我嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F628A919C919C9B5A8B937D66621155CEFF1F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "願意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9858610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是哪一隻醜醜魚呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F54EA4E0096BB919C919C9B5A5462FF1F00100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請把醜醜魚讓給我喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB628A919C919C9B5A8B937D6662115594FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是醜醜魚！\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F919C919C9B5AFF01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好大隻的醜醜魚喔！\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D592796BB7684919C919C9B5A5594FF01000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "異色的醜醜魚！？\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757082727684919C919C9B5AFF01FF1F000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "頭目！？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n而且是異色！？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n怎麼覺得有點可怕，\n但還是超級無敵感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "982D76EEFF01FF1F00100001BE01000A800C4E14662F75708272FF01FF1F00100001BE01000A600E9EBC89BA5F9767099EDE53EF6015FF0C000A4F469084662F8D857D1A71216575611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "醜醜魚，我們要好好相處喔！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "919C919C9B5AFF0C621150118981597D597D76F886555594FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是能跟醜醜魚\n變得相親相愛就好了呢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F80FD8DDF919C919C9B5A000A8B8A5F9776F889AA76F8611B5C31597D4E865462FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咯呦～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54AF5466FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了讓醜醜魚能和鯉魚王變親近，\n所以我把牠放進了池裡！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E868B93919C919C9B5A80FD548C9BC99B5A738B8B8A89AA8FD1FF0C000A62404EE56211628A7260653E90324E866C6088E1FF0100100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟同樣都是魚寶可夢，\n應該能相處得很好的！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n話雖如此，聽說放養\n野生寶可夢要格外小心。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF540C6A2390FD662F9B5A5BF653EF5922FF0C000A61C98A7280FD76F886555F975F88597D7684FF0100100001BE01000A8A7196D659826B64FF0C807D8AAA653E990A000A91CE751F5BF653EF59228981683C59165C0F5FC3300200100002011401CB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看看池子！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n醜醜魚和鯉魚王\n看起來非常要好！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǋ",
